OpenSoftLinking
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source:  https://github.com/MxIris-Reverse-Engineering/OpenSoftLinking
License: GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 (LGPL-2.1)

OpenSoftLinking provides the soft-linking macros AppKitPlus uses to resolve private AppKit classes
that export no linkable symbol. Its macro suite is derived from WebKit's
`Source/WTF/wtf/cocoa/SoftLinking.h`:

    Source:  https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit
    License: GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 (LGPL-2.1)

AppKitPlus vendors these files with two mechanical changes: include paths are quoted rather than
framework-style, and the `_osl_dlopen` / `_osl_dlopen_audited` helpers carry hidden visibility.

The complete corresponding source for this component is publicly available at the URL above. The
LGPL-2.1 license text is available at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/lgpl-2.1.html.

Anyone wishing to modify or relink this component should build AppKitPlus against their own copy;
requests for object files may be directed to the repository's issue tracker.
